, we have given 5 percent of our profit to communities.","zh":null},{"en":"When used in this report, the terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" \"Target,\" and the \"Corporation\" mean Target Corporation and its subsidiaries, collectively, unless the context otherwise requires or indicates.","zh":null},{"en":"Target's strategy is grounded in our purpose to help all families discover the joy of everyday life and our ambition to be the most delightful experience in retail. We differentiate through design, style, and value, and a curated multi-category assortment delivered across stores and digital channels.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Target Corporation was incorporated in Minnesota in 1902. Our corporate purpose is to help all families discover the joy of everyday life. We offer our customers, referred to as \"guests,\" fashionable, differentiated merchandise and everyday essentials at discounted prices. We operate as a single segment designed to enable guests to purchase products seamlessly in stores or through our digital channels. Since 1946, we have given 5 percent of our profit to communities.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with omnichannel retailers, including department stores, off-price general merchandise retailers, wholesale clubs, category-specific retailers, drug stores, supermarkets, direct-to-consumer brands, online marketplaces, and other forms of retail commerce. Our ability to positively differentiate ourselves from other retailers and provide compelling value to our guests largely determines our competitive position within the retail industry.","zh":null},{"en":"Our brand image is a critical element of our business strategy. Our principal trademarks, including Target, our \"Expect More. Pay Less.\" brand promise, and our \"Bullseye Design,\" have been registered with the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office. We also seek to obtain and preserve intellectual property protection for our brands.","zh":null}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":24136000000,"zh":"Food & Beverage"},{"name":"Household Essentials","val":18017000000,"zh":"Household Essentials"},{"name":"Hardlines","val":15800000000,"zh":"Hardlines"},{"name":"Apparel & Accessories","val":15737000000,"zh":"Apparel & Accessories"},{"name":"Home Furnishings & Decor","val":15608000000,"zh":"Home Furnishings & Decor"},{"name":"Beauty","val":13214000000,"zh":"Beauty"},{"name":"Advertising Revenue","val":915000000,"zh":"Advertising Revenue"},{"name":"Other Other Revenue","val":626000000,"zh":"Other Other Revenue"},{"name":"Credit Card Profit Sharing","val":522000000,"zh":"Credit Card Profit Sharing"},{"name":"Other Product","val":205000000,"zh":"Other Product"}],"total":104780000000}},"peers":["WMT","COST","LOW","HD","SBUX"]}}